msgctxt "64"
msgid "How to Play Nine-ball"
msgstr "Come si gioca a Palla Nove:"

msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"Pocket the object balls in order, starting with the lowest\r\n"
"number, by hitting them with the cue ball."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "Your turn continues until you fail to pocket a ball."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "The player who sinks the 9 ball first wins the game."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "Fouls:"
msgstr "Falli:"

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"A foul results if the cue ball falls into a pocket or does\r\n"
"not strike an object ball."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"The opposing player may then take a shot by placing the cue\r\n"
"ball anywhere on the table."
msgstr ""
"L'avversario potrà quindi tirare, piazzando la palla bianca in qualsiasi "
"punto del tavolo."

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Now, let's give it a try."
msgstr "Dai, ora proviamoci."
